1
00:00:00,303 --> 00:00:03,293
That's everything
I've ever wanted in a friend.

2
00:00:04,307 --> 00:00:08,007
(Raj:)Yeah, but if he's a sore loser,
maybe you're better off without him.

3
00:00:08,344 --> 00:00:09,674
(Sheldon:)You're right.

4
00:00:09,879 --> 00:00:12,579
(Sheldon:)I guess I just have to make lemonade
out of the two of you.

5
00:00:16,953 --> 00:00:18,783
Ah! He played. He played.

6
00:00:19,222 --> 00:00:22,212
(Sheldon:)Coop and Rolling Thunder
are together again.

7
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:26,223
(Sheldon:)He was okay with that nickname.

8
00:00:26,863 --> 00:00:30,023
- So now all you have to do is let him win.
- Yeah, way ahead of you.

9
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:34,363
I will play the word "at"
for two measly points...

10
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,100
(Sheldon:)...throwing the game
and thus securing my friendship...

11
00:00:37,273 --> 00:00:39,743
(Sheldon:)...with the smartest man in the world.

12
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:48,743
(Howard:)What are you waiting for? Hit send.

13
00:00:48,951 --> 00:00:52,551
(Sheldon:)I can't. Losing on purpose
is intellectually dishonest.

14
00:00:52,722 --> 00:00:55,592
- So don't do it.
- Oh, but I wanna be Hawking's friend.

15
00:00:55,792 --> 00:00:58,732
- So do it.
- But if I do, I'll be a phony.

16
00:00:58,928 --> 00:01:03,018
(Sheldon:)A sellout. A Hollywood poser.

